  "term": "genistein",
  "definition": "Genistein is a plant-derived isoflavone phytoestrogen found in soybeans. It can act on estrogen receptors and has been studied for biological effects including anti-inflammatory, anti-oxidative, anti-apoptotic, and neuroprotective actions.",
